ve the situation. How can Takumi resolve this and set off to the sea with the twins?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-08-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sGxughtXQEy5d0cgwpVC2MvQjW6.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sGxughtXQEy5d0cgwpVC2MvQjW6.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/240633/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"5462481","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takumi and the children helped the merfolk and were generously rewarded. They head to a small island to finally master water magic, but then they encounter a strange monster.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-08-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yxpQasZUUSPoemIWXLu4CKlH9EK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yxpQasZUUSPoemIWXLu4CKlH9EK.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/240633/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"5462483","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takumi bids farewell to the Azure Palace and continues on his way to Bailey. Along the way, he discovers a dungeon with 30 levels and decides to explore it a bit.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-08-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6bCKNBjJIonA310o1leCnjIp8Ag.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6bCKNBjJIonA310o1leCnjIp8Ag.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/240633/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"5462486","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After arriving in Bailey, Takumi first talks with Syl and receives some news and gifts. Then he heads to the Adventurer's Guild, where a great commotion suddenly breaks out.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-09-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zrYTl5Gh0sNStzc1L6zsdGeqUNx.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zrYTl5Gh0sNStzc1L6zsdGeqUNx.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/240633/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"5462488","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takumi has a conversation with Cedric, the lord of Bailey. Cedric shows particular interest in the food that Takumi has introduced to the land. Cedric's sons also seem enthusiastic.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-09-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/osWazWV7wo2PV8wTLvRnUSOf2Xd.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/osWazWV7wo2PV8wTLvRnUSOf2Xd.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/240633/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"5462490","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takumi has found the trading company that owns the sunken ship. When he returns it, he is introduced to a variety of interesting spices. An idea for a new dish immediately comes to mind!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-09-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sIzKWpDplVa3ABmAfdfUqbrStvy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sIzKWpDplVa3ABmAfdfUqbrStvy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/240633/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"5462491","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takumi arrives once 